  "feedback_addressed": "root review of v13 (v14 task brief, 2026-10-18): pack/roll form modestly improved but an overly busy hard-edged silhouette, thick boot masses and dark-floor lower-body merging remain; v12's full coat partly lost. Earlier: Codex v12 review in the v13 dispatch docs/coordination/rpg-2-star-ocean-the-second_female-battle-static-v13-material-and-real-shadow-dispatch_unapproved-v01_20261017-235000-dfdc7f83.md; creator answer on v11 '继续精修静止帧' (a request for further static refinement, not acceptance)",
  "v14_targets": [
    "back coat tail: v12's fullness back (to x17 / row 54) as cloth with one broad fold, not v12's deep wedge or v13's two dark fold lines",
    "legs: near knee juts forward of the shin, shin drops back to the ankle; far leg braced back with a small knee bend in the body's shadow (deep slate body, spruce front edge)",
    "boots: shaft as wide as the shin (5 colour texels, v13 8), heel steps back, vamp slopes to a rounded toe; dark leather with a lit vamp/toe cap and a two-row lit-leather base (lowest foot row + welt) where the foot stands in the contact shadow (v13: a 3-4 row lit band and a full-width warm-grey welt)",
    "restrained warm edge planes: the existing warm grey (u) only on light-facing planes (near thigh top, near shin front, toe caps); the silhouette edge stays black (no rim light)",
    "pack calmed to one flap, one strap, one buckle; small steel canister on its visible side (identity item); teal drape tucked under the pack so the back contour runs pack -> drape -> tail",
    "roll: v13 cylinder kept, top edge outlined in deep teal instead of black",
    "face: brow drawn in hair brown and separated from a smaller lash line (more mature read); head outline unchanged"
  ],
  "coat_colour_note": "the coat keeps the approved v8 storm-slate ramp (C/c/o); the v13 dispatch confirms no new creator colour decision is needed to follow the approved v8 static identity",
